var e=JSON.parse(`[{"id":29,"slug":"question-29","title":"JSX 和 React Element 是什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q29-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>JSX 是语法扩展，经编译转换为创建 element 描述的调用。React element 是普通、不可变的 UI 描述对象，不是 DOM 节点，也不是组件实例。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">const view = &#x3C;Button color=\\"red\\">Save&#x3C;/Button>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>它描述“希望渲染 Button，并传入哪些 props”。函数组件随后被 React 调用，返回另一棵 element 描述。React 根据这些描述决定宿主环境中的实际操作。</p>\\n<p><code>&#x3C;Button /></code> 与 <code>Button()</code> 不等价：前者让 React 管理组件身份、Hooks、调度和错误边界；直接调用只是普通函数调用，会破坏组件边界和 Hook 归属。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":650}},{"id":30,"slug":"question-30","title":"React 一次更新经过哪些阶段？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q30-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>高层模型：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>Trigger/Schedule</strong>：初次挂载或 state/props/context/external store 变化触发工作。</li>\\n<li><strong>Render phase</strong>：React 调用组件，计算下一棵 UI；这一阶段应纯粹，在并发模式下可能暂停、重做或放弃。</li>\\n<li><strong>Reconciliation</strong>：比较新旧描述，决定保留、更新、插入和删除哪些节点。</li>\\n<li><strong>Commit phase</strong>：把确定的变化应用到 DOM，并处理 ref、layout effect 等；该阶段不能像 render 一样随意丢弃。</li>\\n<li>浏览器绘制；普通 Effect 通常在合适时机执行。</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>“组件重新渲染”只表示组件函数再次执行以计算 UI，不等于 DOM 一定变化。React 可能发现宿主节点属性和结构都没变，因此无需改 DOM。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":668}},{"id":31,"slug":"question-31","title":"reconciliation 是什么？Virtual DOM diff 的复杂度如何理解？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q31-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>通用树编辑距离代价很高。React 基于 UI 的常见结构采用启发式：不同 element type 通常视为不同子树；同层列表借助 key 匹配身份。这样可以在线性扫描同级子节点的常见路径中完成协调。</p>\\n<p>不要把它简化为“Virtual DOM 一定比直接 DOM 快”。Virtual DOM 的主要价值是声明式模型、跨更新协调、批处理和调度空间；具体性能仍取决于组件结构、计算量和真实 DOM 工作。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":690}},{"id":32,"slug":"question-32","title":"key 的真正作用是什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q32-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>key 与 element type 一起帮助 React 识别<strong>同一父节点下兄弟元素的身份</strong>。稳定 key 让 React 在插入、删除、排序时把旧 state/DOM 与正确的新元素对应。</p>\\n<p>使用 index 的风险：列表中间插入、删除或重排后，同一个 index 可能代表另一条业务数据，导致输入值、局部 state 或动画错位。只有列表静态、不会排序/过滤，且元素没有需要保留的身份状态时，index 才相对安全。</p>\\n<p>改变 key 会让 React 把元素视为新身份，因此可以有意重置表单 state。key 不会作为普通 prop 传给组件。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":705}},{"id":33,"slug":"question-33","title":"state 保存在哪里？为什么说它是 snapshot？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q33-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>state 不存于组件函数局部变量里，而由 React 根据组件在树中的位置/身份维护。每次 React 调用组件，会给这次 render 一份 state 快照；该次 render 创建的事件处理器和闭包读取的也是这份快照。</p>\\n<p>调用 setter 是请求未来更新，不会修改已经运行中的局部变量：</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function Counter() {\\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0)\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function handleClick() {\\r\\nsetCount(count + 1)\\r\\nconsole.log(count) // 当前 render 的快照，仍为 0\\r\\n}\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<p>这不是“异步变量赋值”的简单问题，而是 React render 模型：每次 render 的值保持一致，让代码可推理。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":721}},{"id":34,"slug":"question-34","title":"batching 与 state update queue 如何工作？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q34-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>React 会把一个处理边界中的多个更新排队，避免每个 setter 都立即产生一次完整 render。对同一个 state：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>setX(value)</code> 可理解为加入“替换为 value”的更新。</li>\\n<li><code>setX(prev => next)</code> 加入基于队列前一结果计算的 updater。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">setNumber(number + 5)\\nsetNumber(n => n + 1)\\nsetNumber(42)\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>若当前 number 为 0，队列大致得到：替换 5 → updater 得 6 → 替换 42，最终是 42。</p>\\n<p>React 18+ 在 <code>createRoot</code> 下扩大了自动 batching 范围，但不要把“自动批处理”解释成永远只 render 一次。不同用户事件、<code>flushSync</code>、优先级和同步外部 store 等边界会影响行为。需要基于前一值时始终用函数式更新。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":746}},{"id":35,"slug":"question-35","title":"props、state、普通变量和 ref 的区别是什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q35-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>props：父组件传入的当前 render 输入，只读。</li>\\n<li>state：由 React 管理，setter 会请求 render。</li>\\n<li>普通局部变量：每次 render 重新计算，修改不会保留也不会触发 render。</li>\\n<li>ref：跨 render 保留同一个容器，修改 <code>.current</code> 不触发 render。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>选择标准：影响页面输出且会变化的数据用 state；仅需跨 render 保存但不参与渲染的 imperative 信息（DOM、timer id、latest value）可用 ref；能由 props/state 计算出的值通常直接计算，不另存 state。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":770}},{"id":36,"slug":"question-36","title":"什么是派生状态？为什么经常不需要 Effect？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","Effect"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q36-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>如果一个值能从当前 props/state 纯计算得到，它就是派生数据，通常应在 render 中计算：</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">// 不推荐：多一份状态、一次旧 UI、额外 render\\nuseEffect(() => setFullName(\`\${first} \${last}\`), [first, last])\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">// 推荐\\r\\nconst fullName = <code>\${first} \${last}</code>\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<p>昂贵计算可在测量后用 memoization，但不要用 Effect 同步两份可推导状态。真正需要 state 的情况通常是要保留用户独立编辑的值，或保存某个历史快照，而不是当前输入的函数。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":790}},{"id":37,"slug":"question-37","title":"受控组件与非受控组件如何选择？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q37-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>受控输入的当前值来自 React state，并通过 <code>onChange</code> 更新；非受控输入主要由 DOM 保持值，通过 ref 或提交时读取。</p>\\n<p>受控适合即时校验、联动、格式化和统一状态；非受控适合简单表单、第三方 DOM 集成或减少逐键状态协调。文件输入天然主要由用户和 DOM 控制。</p>\\n<p>“组件受控”也可泛指父组件通过 prop 控制某个行为。设计组件 API 时避免同一状态在受控/非受控之间切换，并明确 <code>value/defaultValue</code> 语义。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":811}},{"id":38,"slug":"question-38","title":"为什么 Hooks 不能写在条件、循环或普通函数里？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","Hooks"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q38-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>React 需要在每次 render 中按稳定顺序把 Hook 调用与该组件的 Hook 状态对应。条件调用会让后续 Hook 的位置错位。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">// 错误\\nif (enabled) {\\n  const [x, setX] = useState(0)\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>Hooks 只能在 React 函数组件或自定义 Hook 顶层调用。<code>use</code> API 在支持的场景有不同规则，但不能据此推翻其他 Hooks 的顺序要求。实际项目使用 eslint-plugin-react-hooks 自动检查。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":827}},{"id":39,"slug":"question-39","title":"Hooks 在内部为什么常被描述为链表？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","Hooks"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q39-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>在常见 React 实现中，函数组件对应的 Fiber 会关联一组按调用顺序组织的 Hook 记录；mount 时创建，update 时按顺序复用。链表是源码实现细节，真正稳定的设计约束是：React 依赖调用顺序把某次 <code>useState/useEffect</code> 与之前那一项状态对应。</p>\\n<p>面试回答不要把某版本字段名当 API 保证。解释“顺序对应”以及条件 Hook 为什么会错位，比背 <code>memoizedState/next</code> 更重要。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":847}},{"id":40,"slug":"question-40","title":"useEffect 的本质用途是什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","Effect"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q40-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Effect 用于让组件与 React 外部系统同步，例如网络连接、DOM imperative API、订阅、定时器、第三方组件。它不是通用生命周期替代品，也不是“render 后随便做点事”。</p>\\n<p>判断方法：先指出外部系统。如果没有外部系统，通常考虑直接计算、事件处理、状态提升或 reducer。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">useEffect(() => {\\n  const connection = connect(roomId)\\n  return () => connection.disconnect()\\n}, [roomId])\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>当依赖变化时，React 先用旧值执行 cleanup，再用新值 setup；卸载时最后 cleanup。Effect 只在客户端运行，不在 server render 中运行。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":862}},{"id":41,"slug":"question-41","title":"dependency array 应该怎样理解？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q41-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>它不是“我希望什么时候执行”的开关，而是 Effect 代码读取的所有 reactive value 的声明。React 使用 <code>Object.is</code> 比较依赖。</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>无数组：每次 commit 后都可能执行。</li>\\n<li><code>[]</code>：此 Effect 不读取会随 render 变化的 reactive value；不是“强制只执行一次”的语义承诺，Strict Mode 开发期还会额外 setup/cleanup。</li>\\n<li><code>[a, b]</code>：a/b 变化时重新同步。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>遇到对象/函数依赖频繁变化，先调整代码结构：把只供 Effect 使用的对象放进 Effect，把非响应逻辑移出组件，或拆分 Effect。不要关闭 lint 或随意删依赖掩盖 stale closure。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":883}},{"id":42,"slug":"question-42","title":"什么是 stale closure？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q42-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>每次 render 都创建新的局部变量和函数闭包。旧回调仍引用创建它时的快照，就会读取旧值：</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">useEffect(() => {\\n  const id = setInterval(() => {\\n    setCount(count + 1) // 若依赖为空，count 可能一直是初始值\\n  }, 1000)\\n  return () => clearInterval(id)\\n}, [])\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>若更新只依赖前值：</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">setCount(c => c + 1)\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>如果确实需要最新值但不希望重新订阅，可根据场景使用 ref，或当前 React 提供的 Effect Event 等明确机制。不要把所有值都塞进 ref，因为那会绕过响应式数据流。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":903}},{"id":43,"slug":"question-43","title":"如何处理 Effect 中的请求竞态？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","Effect","请求"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q43-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>当参数 A 请求先发后回、参数 B 后发先回时，A 可能覆盖 B。两类处理：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>使用 <code>AbortController</code> 真正取消支持取消的请求。</li>\\n<li>cleanup 标记当前 Effect 已失效，忽略旧结果。</li>\\n</ol>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">useEffect(() => {\\n  const controller = new AbortController()\\n  let active = true\\n<p>async function load() {\\r\\ntry {\\r\\nconst res = await fetch(<code>/api?q=\${query}</code>, {\\r\\nsignal: controller.signal,\\r\\n})\\r\\nconst data = await res.json()\\r\\nif (active) setData(data)\\r\\n} catch (error) {\\r\\nif (error.name !== 'AbortError' &#x26;&#x26; active) setError(error)\\r\\n}\\r\\n}</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">load()\\r\\nreturn () => {\\r\\nactive = false\\r\\ncontroller.abort()\\r\\n}\\r\\n}, [query])\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<p>成熟项目通常还会通过 router loader 或 server-state library 处理缓存、去重、重试与竞态，避免每个组件重复造请求生命周期。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":928}},{"id":44,"slug":"question-44","title":"useEffect 与 useLayoutEffect 有什么区别？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","Effect"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q44-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>两者都在 commit 后运行于客户端。<code>useLayoutEffect</code> 在浏览器绘制前同步执行，并可能阻塞绘制，适合读取布局后立即修正 tooltip 等必须避免闪烁的视觉工作；<code>useEffect</code> 通常允许浏览器先绘制，适合大多数外部同步。</p>\\n<p>默认选择 <code>useEffect</code>。不要为了“更早”把所有逻辑换成 layout effect；它会延迟页面展示。SSR 环境还要注意 layout effect 只在客户端执行。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":970}},{"id":45,"slug":"question-45","title":"Strict Mode 为什么会看到组件或 Effect 多执行一次？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","Effect"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q45-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>在开发环境，Strict Mode 会额外执行某些行为来发现不纯 render、缺失 cleanup 和 ref callback 清理问题。Effect 会经历额外的 setup → cleanup → setup 压力测试；生产环境不会因此机械地执行两次。</p>\\n<p>正确处理不是关闭 Strict Mode，而是让 render 纯粹、让 setup/cleanup 对称、让网络或写操作具备幂等/取消策略。若额外执行暴露重复订阅，它通常说明真实导航或 remount 时也可能出错。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":985}},{"id":46,"slug":"question-46","title":"ref 有哪些用途和风险？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q46-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>用途：访问 DOM、保存 timer/request/third-party instance、保存不参与 UI 的可变值。修改 <code>.current</code> 不触发 render，因此把页面显示依赖的数据放 ref 会造成 UI 不同步。</p>\\n<p>读取或写入 ref 通常应在事件或 Effect 中进行；render 中随意改变 ref 会破坏纯度。回调 ref 也要清理。React 19 中 function component 可将 <code>ref</code> 作为 prop 使用；面对 React 18 存量代码仍要理解 <code>forwardRef</code>。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1000}},{"id":47,"slug":"question-47","title":"memo、useMemo、useCallback 分别做什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q47-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>memo(Component)</code>：props 按浅层 <code>Object.is</code> 语义相同时，允许 React 跳过该组件的部分重复 render。</li>\\n<li><code>useMemo(factory, deps)</code>：缓存一次计算结果。</li>\\n<li><code>useCallback(fn, deps)</code>：缓存函数引用，近似 <code>useMemo(() => fn, deps)</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>它们是性能优化，不是正确性工具。常见无效情况：计算本来很便宜；父组件每次传新对象使 memo 失效；组件自身 state/context 更新；比较成本接近或超过 render；依赖频繁变化。</p>\\n<p>正确流程：Profiler 找到昂贵且重复的 render → 调整状态/组件/订阅边界 → 必要时 memoize → 复测。React Compiler 可自动做一部分 memoization，但仍不替代正确的数据流和性能测量。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1015}},{"id":48,"slug":"question-48","title":"Context 为什么可能引起大范围更新？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","Context"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q48-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Provider 的 value 变化时，读取该 Context 的消费者需要获得新值。若 value 每次 render 都是新对象，或一个大 Context 同时包含高频和低频字段，会扩大更新范围。</p>\\n<p>优化顺序：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>将 state 放到离消费者最近的位置。</li>\\n<li>拆分不同变化频率/职责的 Context。</li>\\n<li>保持 Provider value 合理稳定。</li>\\n<li>高频、大规模、细粒度订阅需求考虑 external store/selector。</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p><code>memo</code> 不能阻止组件因自己读取的 Context 变化而更新。不要默认“所有全局状态都用 Context”。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1035}},{"id":49,"slug":"question-49","title":"useReducer 什么时候比 useState 合适？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q49-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>当多个字段围绕同一业务事件一起变化、状态转换复杂、需要集中验证不变量或便于测试时，reducer 更合适。它把“发生了什么”与“如何变化”分离。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-ts\\">type Action =\\n  | { type: 'submit' }\\n  | { type: 'success'; data: Data }\\n  | { type: 'failure'; error: Error }\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>reducer 必须纯，不应在其中请求接口或写日志。简单且彼此独立的状态无需强行 reducer。<code>useReducer</code> 也不自动等于全局状态管理。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1057}},{"id":50,"slug":"question-50","title":"如何设计一个好的自定义 Hook？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","Hook"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q50-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>自定义 Hook 复用的是有状态逻辑，不是共享同一份 state。每次调用仍有独立 Hook 状态。</p>\\n<p>好 Hook：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>名称表达能力而非生命周期，例如 <code>useChatConnection</code>。</li>\\n<li>API 小而明确，暴露业务动作而非大量内部 setter。</li>\\n<li>setup/cleanup 对称，依赖清晰。</li>\\n<li>返回值稳定性有意识，但不为稳定而过度 memo。</li>\\n<li>对错误、取消、并发和 SSR 有明确边界。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>如果 Hook 只是包一行 <code>useState</code> 且没有形成稳定抽象，价值有限。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1077}},{"id":51,"slug":"question-51","title":"React 事件和原生 DOM 事件有什么关系？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q51-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>React 提供跨浏览器一致的事件接口，并通常通过根容器上的事件系统处理。事件仍遵循捕获/冒泡概念，但 React tree 与 DOM tree 可能因 Portal 等不完全一致。</p>\\n<p><code>stopPropagation</code> 阻止传播，<code>preventDefault</code> 阻止默认行为，两者不同。现代 SyntheticEvent 不再需要 <code>persist()</code> 才能异步读取。混用原生监听和 React handler 时，要明确监听位置、阶段和调用顺序。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1100}},{"id":52,"slug":"question-52","title":"Portal 中的事件为什么可能冒泡到视觉上不相邻的父组件？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q52-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Portal 只改变 DOM 放置位置，不改变它在 React tree 中的逻辑父子关系。因此 Context 仍可用，事件也按 React tree 传播。这适合 modal/tooltip，但可能让只看 DOM 的事件判断产生误解。</p>\\n<p>Portal 还需处理 focus management、aria、scroll lock、层级和卸载 cleanup，不能只解决 <code>z-index</code>。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1115}},{"id":53,"slug":"question-53","title":"Error Boundary 能捕获哪些错误？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q53-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Error Boundary 捕获其子树在 render、构造和部分生命周期中的错误，并显示 fallback。它通常不捕获：事件处理器错误、任意异步 callback 错误、服务端渲染错误，以及 boundary 自身错误。</p>\\n<p>请求错误一般进入数据层的 error state；事件错误在事件边界 <code>try/catch</code>；程序 render 错误交给 Error Boundary。错误边界应按路由/关键区域合理布置，并记录错误、组件栈、版本等信息。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1130}},{"id":54,"slug":"question-54","title":"外部 store 为什么需要 useSyncExternalStore？什么是 tearing？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q54-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>并发 render 可能在不同时间读取外部可变数据。如果同一次 UI 计算的不同组件看到不同版本，就可能 tearing。<code>useSyncExternalStore</code> 提供 React 能正确协调的 subscribe/getSnapshot 协议，并支持 server snapshot。</p>\\n<p>要求：<code>getSnapshot</code> 在 store 未变化时返回稳定结果；变化时返回新的不可变 snapshot；<code>subscribe</code> 返回 unsubscribe。它主要面向状态库作者和浏览器外部数据源封装，普通业务不必手写 store。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1145}},{"id":55,"slug":"question-55","title":"startTransition/useTransition 解决什么问题？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q55-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Transition 将某些更新标记为非紧急，让输入、点击等紧急交互优先。后台 render 可被更高优先级更新打断并重做，减少界面卡顿。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition()\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function handleChange(e) {\\r\\nconst next = e.target.value\\r\\nsetInput(next) // 紧急：输入必须立即更新\\r\\nstartTransition(() => {\\r\\nsetFilter(next) // 非紧急：昂贵列表可后台更新\\r\\n})\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<p>Transition 不会让计算变快，也不是 debounce；它改变调度优先级。不能用 Transition 控制文本输入值。异步 action 中 await 后的更新在某些版本/场景仍需再次包裹，应以当前官方文档为准。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1160}},{"id":56,"slug":"question-56","title":"useDeferredValue 与 debounce 有什么区别？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","debounce"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q56-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p><code>useDeferredValue</code> 让某个值的消费方落后更新，后台 render 可中断，没有固定毫秒延迟；debounce 在时间层面减少回调/请求触发次数。</p>\\n<p><code>useDeferredValue</code> 自身不会减少网络请求。常见组合：输入 state 立即更新，查询请求按产品需求 debounce/cache，昂贵结果渲染使用 deferred value 保持输入响应。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1185}},{"id":57,"slug":"question-57","title":"Suspense 是什么？它是否会自动请求数据？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","Suspense","请求"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q57-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Suspense 是协调“子树尚未准备好”时 fallback 与 reveal 的 UI 边界。它本身不是数据请求库，不会因为把普通 fetch 写进 Effect 就自动工作。</p>\\n<p>常见支持来源：<code>lazy</code> 代码加载、支持 Suspense 的框架/数据层、<code>use</code> 读取 Promise 等。边界位置决定用户看到局部 skeleton、保留旧内容还是整页 fallback。设计重点是 reveal 顺序、错误边界和避免已展示内容反复被大 spinner 替换。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1200}},{"id":58,"slug":"question-58","title":"lazy 与动态 import 如何实现代码分割？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q58-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>动态 <code>import()</code> 给 bundler 创建异步 chunk 的边界，<code>lazy(() => import(...))</code> 让 React 在需要组件时加载模块，并通过 Suspense 展示 fallback。</p>\\n<p>路由级通常是合理起点；过细拆分会增加请求、fallback 和复杂度。模块加载失败要配 Error Boundary/重试或刷新策略。chunk 命名和长期缓存要结合构建工具分析。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1215}},{"id":59,"slug":"question-59","title":"SSR、hydration、streaming SSR 分别是什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","SSR"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q59-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>SSR：服务器为请求生成 HTML，让用户更早看到内容，也有利于部分 SEO/分享场景。</li>\\n<li>hydration：客户端 React 在已有 HTML 上建立事件和组件能力；服务端和客户端首个输出必须匹配。</li>\\n<li>streaming SSR：服务器分块发送 HTML，让已准备部分先到达，常与 Suspense 边界协调。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>常见 hydration mismatch：render 中使用 <code>Date.now/random</code>、直接读取浏览器环境、本地化/时区不同、非法 HTML 嵌套、服务端和客户端数据不一致。不要用 suppress warning 掩盖真实不一致。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1230}},{"id":60,"slug":"question-60","title":"Server Component 与 SSR 是同一个概念吗？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","SSR"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q60-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>不是。SSR 关注把某次 UI 渲染成 HTML；Server Component 是组件模块边界与传输模型，一些组件只在服务器执行，其结果以特定表示传给客户端，减少客户端 JS 并允许靠近数据源。</p>\\n<p>Server Component 不能使用仅客户端的 state/effect/DOM API；Client Component 边界需要明确，传递数据通常要求可序列化。它强依赖框架和构建实现，不建议在无框架业务里自行拼装。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1249}},{"id":61,"slug":"question-61","title":"React 19 的 Actions、useActionState、useOptimistic 解决什么问题？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q61-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Actions 围绕异步 mutation 组织 pending、错误、表单提交和乐观反馈。<code>useActionState</code> 管理 action 返回状态与 pending；<code>useOptimistic</code> 在操作进行中展示预期结果，并在真实结果到达后协调；<code>useFormStatus</code> 可读取父 form 提交状态。</p>\\n<p>它们减少重复样板，但不会替你解决业务幂等、权限、服务端验证、冲突合并和缓存一致性。乐观更新前要判断失败概率、回滚成本和用户是否能理解冲突。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1264}},{"id":62,"slug":"question-62","title":"React Compiler 会让 useMemo/useCallback 消失吗？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q62-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>Compiler 可以在构建时分析并自动 memoize 一部分组件和值，减少手写 memoization。它不意味着所有性能问题消失，也不改变组件必须纯、Hook 规则、状态边界、订阅粒度和算法复杂度。</p>\\n<p>存量项目是否启用要看编译兼容、第三方库、lint、构建链和回归测试。面试中应说“先写正确纯粹的组件并测量，再决定 Compiler/手工 memo”，不要声称全面删除所有 memo API。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1279}},{"id":63,"slug":"question-63","title":"React 19.3 有哪些需要了解但不用死背的变化？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q63-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>截至 2026-09-14，官方最新稳定版本为 React 19.3，新增或稳定化了 View Transitions、Fragment Refs、<code>browser()</code>、Trusted Types 支持等，并继续演进 Server Component 能力。</p>\\n<p>求职策略：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>知道这些能力解决什么问题、对构建/框架有什么要求。</li>\\n<li>不把新 API 当通用基础题，更不要假装在生产中使用过。</li>\\n<li>国内存量岗位仍可能基于较早版本，应能区分当前推荐写法和旧代码迁移。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>资料：<a href=\\"https://react.dev/blog/2026/09/09/react-19-3\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">React 19.3 官方发布说明</a>、<a href=\\"https://react.dev/versions\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">React Versions</a>。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1294}},{"id":64,"slug":"question-64","title":"为什么 render 中不能产生副作用？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q64-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>render 可能被 React 调用多次、暂停、丢弃或为不同优先级重新开始。如果在 render 中修改外部变量、发请求、操作 DOM，就可能在没有 commit 的情况下产生不可撤销影响，导致重复写入和 UI/外部世界不一致。</p>\\n<p>render 只根据 props/state/context 计算 element。由用户操作直接引发的写操作通常放事件处理器；需要与渲染结果保持同步的外部连接放 Effect。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1315}},{"id":65,"slug":"question-65","title":"父组件 render，子组件一定 render 吗？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q65-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>默认情况下，父组件重新执行并返回子 element，React 通常会继续处理其子组件；如果子组件是 <code>memo</code> 且 props 相等，或已有 element 对象被作为稳定 children 等，React可能跳过部分工作。子组件自己的 state/context 变化也会使其更新。</p>\\n<p>但“render”必须区分：组件函数执行、Fiber 工作、DOM commit。即使子函数执行，DOM 也可能完全不变。优化前应由 Profiler 证明子 render 昂贵且重复。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1330}},{"id":66,"slug":"question-66","title":"为什么把组件定义在另一个组件内部可能丢失 state？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q66-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>外层每次 render 都会创建一个新的函数对象作为 element type。React 看到当前位置的 type 改变，会把它当成新组件，卸载旧树并挂载新树，局部 state 随之重置。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function Parent() {\\n  function Child() { /* 每次 Parent render 都是新 type */ }\\n  return &#x3C;Child />\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>应把组件定义移到模块顶层；需要捕获数据时通过 props 传递。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1345}},{"id":67,"slug":"question-67","title":"React 中为什么不建议把 props 复制到 state？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q67-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>复制后会形成两个真相来源：prop 更新时 state 是否覆盖？用户本地编辑是否保留？Effect 同步常带来一帧旧值和额外 render。</p>\\n<p>如果只是派生，直接计算；如果要保留“初始值后独立编辑”，使用 <code>initialX/defaultX</code> 命名明确语义；若切换实体需要重置，可由 key 表达身份，或在事件/状态机中显式处理。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1365}},{"id":68,"slug":"question-68","title":"React 列表性能差，应按什么顺序排查？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","性能"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q68-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<ol>\\n<li>在 production build 和可复现数据下用 React Profiler/Performance 记录。</li>\\n<li>判断瓶颈是数据计算、组件 render、DOM 数量、layout/paint 还是网络。</li>\\n<li>检查 key、state 位置、Context/selector 订阅范围。</li>\\n<li>数据量巨大先考虑分页或虚拟化；昂贵计算再考虑 memo。</li>\\n<li>拆分高频更新区域，避免整表跟随一个输入更新。</li>\\n<li>同条件复测并记录 trade-off。</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>虚拟化能减少 DOM，但引入动态高度、可访问性、查找、打印和滚动定位复杂度，不是所有列表都需要。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1380}},{"id":69,"slug":"question-69","title":"React 测试应该测试什么？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","测试"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q69-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>优先测试用户可观察行为和高风险边界：用户看到什么、点击/输入什么、最终状态是什么。避免断言内部 state、私有方法、CSS 类或 Hook 调用次数。</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>reducer/权限/转换：unit。</li>\\n<li>表单、请求状态、交互：component/integration。</li>\\n<li>登录、创建、支付等关键链路：E2E。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>异步测试使用语义查询和可等待断言，控制接口数据，保持测试隔离。测试数量和 coverage 不是唯一目标，失败时能否指出业务风险更重要。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1402}},{"id":70,"slug":"question-70","title":"React 项目中 server state 与 client state 如何划分？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q70-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>server state 由服务端拥有，具有异步、共享、可能过期、缓存/重试/失效等特点；client state 由当前 UI 拥有，如弹窗、草稿、当前 tab。URL state 用于可分享、刷新保留和导航相关状态。</p>\\n<p>不要把请求结果同时复制进 query cache 和全局 store。先定义唯一权威来源；需要组合展示时使用 selector/派生。mutation 后采用精确 cache update、invalidation 或服务端返回结果，策略取决于一致性和请求成本。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1422}},{"id":71,"slug":"question-71","title":"React 中“状态下沉”为什么常比 memo 更有效？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q71-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>如果高频 state 位于大组件顶部，每次更新都会让整个子树参与 render。把状态移动到真正使用它的小组件，或让包装组件接收稳定 children，可以从源头缩小更新范围。</p>\\n<p>memo 是更新发生后的跳过机制；状态下沉减少了需要考虑的子树，通常更易读、依赖更少，也不要求调用方维护引用稳定性。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1437}},{"id":72,"slug":"question-72","title":"React 中如何避免重复提交？","category":"react","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q72-section-0","title":"答案","html":"\\n<p>前端可在 pending 时禁用触发器、合并同一操作、生成请求 id；但仅禁用按钮不能解决双击竞态、刷新重试或多端请求。服务端应使用幂等键、唯一约束或状态机确保最终安全。</p>\\n<p>UI 需要明确 pending/success/error，并避免错误时永久禁用。乐观更新失败要回滚或重新拉取权威状态。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1452}},{"id":98,"slug":"question-98","title":"修复异步计数器的 stale state","category":"react","type":"debugging","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","state"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<h3>题目</h3>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">async function handleBuy() {\\r\\n  setPending(pending + 1)\\r\\n  await buy()\\r\\n  setPending(pending - 1)\\r\\n  setCompleted(completed + 1)\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>快速点击时计数错误，如何修复？</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q98-section-0","title":"参考答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">async function handleBuy() {\\n  setPending(value => value + 1)\\n  try {\\n    await buy()\\n    setCompleted(value => value + 1)\\n  } finally {\\n    setPending(value => value - 1)\\n  }\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>每个 handler 闭包读取的是触发时的 snapshot。下一值依赖前值时使用 updater；<code>finally</code> 确保失败也减少 pending。生产中还应决定失败计数、重复提交和卸载后的结果处理。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2236}},{"id":99,"slug":"question-99","title":"实现 useLatest","category":"react","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q99-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">import { useRef } from 'react'\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function useLatest(value) {\\r\\nconst ref = useRef(value)\\r\\nref.current = value\\r\\nreturn ref\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q99-section-1","title":"使用边界","html":"\\n<p>它让异步回调读取最新值，但不会触发 render，也不应拿来逃避 Effect dependency。适合保存 latest callback/value 供事件或订阅回调读取。对当前 React 的 Effect Event 能力也应了解，并根据项目版本选择。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2273}},{"id":100,"slug":"question-100","title":"实现 useDebouncedValue","category":"react","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q100-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">import { useEffect, useState } from 'react'\\n<p>function useDebouncedValue(value, delay) {\\r\\nconst [debounced, setDebounced] = useState(value)</p>\\n<p>useEffect(() => {\\r\\nconst id = setTimeout(() => setDebounced(value), delay)\\r\\nreturn () => clearTimeout(id)\\r\\n}, [value, delay])</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">return debounced\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q100-section-1","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>首次是否立即返回原值？这版是。</li>\\n<li>delay 变化是否重启计时？这版会。</li>\\n<li>它不会取消基于旧值已经发出的请求。</li>\\n<li>如果目的是延迟昂贵 render 而不是减少调用次数，应比较 <code>useDeferredValue</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2295}},{"id":101,"slug":"question-101","title":"实现稳定的 useEventListener","category":"react","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q101-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">import { useEffect, useRef } from 'react'\\n<p>function useEventListener(target, type, listener, options) {\\r\\nconst listenerRef = useRef(listener)\\r\\nlistenerRef.current = listener</p>\\n<p>useEffect(() => {\\r\\nconst node = target?.current ?? target\\r\\nif (!node?.addEventListener) return</p>\\n<pre><code>const handler = event =&#x26;gt; listenerRef.current(event)\\r\\nnode.addEventListener(type, handler, options)\\r\\n\\r\\nreturn () =&#x26;gt; node.removeEventListener(type, handler, options)\\n</code></pre>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">}, [target, type, options])\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q101-section-1","title":"边界与改进","html":"\\n<p>对象形式 options 若每次创建新引用会重复订阅，可让调用方稳定它，或只提取 <code>capture/passive/once</code> 等字段。<code>removeEventListener</code> 的匹配重点是 type、listener 和 capture。SSR 时 target 不存在应安全跳过。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2327}},{"id":102,"slug":"question-102","title":"实现一个可被 useSyncExternalStore 订阅的 store","category":"react","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q102-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-js\\">function createStore(initialState) {\\n  let state = initialState\\n  const listeners = new Set()\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-js\\">return {\\r\\ngetSnapshot() {\\r\\nreturn state\\r\\n},\\r\\nsetState(updater) {\\r\\nconst next = typeof updater === 'function' ? updater(state) : updater\\r\\nif (Object.is(next, state)) return\\r\\nstate = next\\r\\nfor (const listener of [...listeners]) listener()\\r\\n},\\r\\nsubscribe(listener) {\\r\\nlisteners.add(listener)\\r\\nreturn () => listeners.delete(listener)\\r\\n},\\r\\n}\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">import { useSyncExternalStore } from 'react'\\n\\nconst counterStore = createStore({ count: 0 })\\n\\nfunction Counter() {\\n  const snapshot = useSyncExternalStore(\\n    counterStore.subscribe,\\n    counterStore.getSnapshot,\\n    counterStore.getSnapshot,\\n  )\\n\\n  return &#x3C;button>{snapshot.count}&#x3C;/button>\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q102-section-1","title":"评分点","html":"\\n<p>snapshot 未变化时必须保持同一引用；状态变化应创建新 snapshot。SSR 的 <code>getServerSnapshot</code> 必须与 hydration 数据策略一致。真实 store 还要 selector、批处理和错误隔离。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2358}},{"id":103,"slug":"question-103","title":"设计一个请求状态 reducer","category":"react","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","请求","reducer"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q103-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-ts\\">type State&#x3C;T> =\\n  | { status: 'idle' }\\n  | { status: 'loading'; requestId: number }\\n  | { status: 'success'; data: T }\\n  | { status: 'error'; error: Error }\\n<p>type Action&#x3C;T> =\\r\\n| { type: 'start'; requestId: number }\\r\\n| { type: 'success'; requestId: number; data: T }\\r\\n| { type: 'error'; requestId: number; error: Error }\\r\\n| { type: 'reset' }</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-ts\\">function reducer&#x3C;T>(state: State&#x3C;T>, action: Action&#x3C;T>): State&#x3C;T> {\\r\\nswitch (action.type) {\\r\\ncase 'start':\\r\\nreturn { status: 'loading', requestId: action.requestId }\\r\\ncase 'success':\\r\\nif (state.status !== 'loading' || state.requestId !== action.requestId) {\\r\\nreturn state\\r\\n}\\r\\nreturn { status: 'success', data: action.data }\\r\\ncase 'error':\\r\\nif (state.status !== 'loading' || state.requestId !== action.requestId) {\\r\\nreturn state\\r\\n}\\r\\nreturn { status: 'error', error: action.error }\\r\\ncase 'reset':\\r\\nreturn { status: 'idle' }\\r\\ndefault: {\\r\\nconst neverAction: never = action\\r\\nreturn neverAction\\r\\n}\\r\\n}\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q103-section-1","title":"设计点","html":"\\n<p>union 排除了同时 loading/success/error 的非法状态，requestId 防止旧请求覆盖新请求。reducer 纯粹，请求副作用放事件/Effect/数据层。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2407}},{"id":104,"slug":"question-104","title":"修复搜索组件的竞态、错误与卸载问题","category":"react","type":"debugging","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q104-section-0","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function Search({ query }) {\\n  const [state, setState] = useState({ status: 'idle' })\\n<p>useEffect(() => {\\r\\nif (!query.trim()) {\\r\\nsetState({ status: 'idle' })\\r\\nreturn\\r\\n}</p>\\n<pre><code>const controller = new AbortController()\\r\\nlet active = true\\r\\nsetState({ status: 'loading' })\\r\\n\\r\\n;(async () =&#x26;gt; {\\r\\n  try {\\r\\n    const response = await fetch(\`/api/search?q=\${encodeURIComponent(query)}\`, {\\r\\n      signal: controller.signal,\\r\\n    })\\r\\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\`HTTP \${response.status}\`)\\r\\n    const data = await response.json()\\r\\n    if (active) setState({ status: 'success', data })\\r\\n  } catch (error) {\\r\\n    if (active &#x26;amp;&#x26;amp; error.name !== 'AbortError') {\\r\\n      setState({ status: 'error', error })\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n})()\\r\\n\\r\\nreturn () =&#x26;gt; {\\r\\n  active = false\\r\\n  controller.abort()\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>}, [query])</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">// 根据 discriminated state 渲染 idle/loading/error/empty/success\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q104-section-1","title":"进一步回答","html":"\\n<p>实际应用优先评估 router loader/server-state library，以获得缓存、请求去重、失效和 SSR 集成。若输入每个字符都请求，还需 debounce；如果结果列表 render 很慢，再考虑 deferred value/transition。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2456}},{"id":105,"slug":"question-105","title":"设计一个 controlled/uncontrolled 通用组件 Hook","category":"react","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React","Hook"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q105-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function useControllableState({ value, defaultValue, onChange }) {\\n  const [internalValue, setInternalValue] = useState(defaultValue)\\n  const controlled = value !== undefined\\n  const current = controlled ? value : internalValue\\n<p>const setValue = useCallback(\\r\\nnext => {\\r\\nconst resolved = typeof next === 'function' ? next(current) : next\\r\\nif (!controlled) setInternalValue(resolved)\\r\\nif (!Object.is(resolved, current)) onChange?.(resolved)\\r\\n},\\r\\n[controlled, current, onChange],\\r\\n)</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">return [current, setValue]\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q105-section-1","title":"追问","html":"\\n<p>应在开发期警告组件从 controlled 切换为 uncontrolled 或反向切换；函数式更新在并发场景还要谨慎，因为 <code>current</code> 是当前 render snapshot。组件库需定义清楚 <code>undefined</code> 是否代表非受控，以及 <code>null</code> 的业务语义。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2508}},{"id":106,"slug":"question-106","title":"如何让 10,000 行列表的搜索输入保持响应？","category":"react","type":"scenario","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q106-section-0","title":"合格答案","html":"\\n<p>先测量，不能直接回答“加 useMemo”。分层解决：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>输入 state 与筛选结果 state/计算分开。</li>\\n<li>数据非常大时优先服务端搜索/分页，或客户端虚拟化减少 DOM。</li>\\n<li>纯 CPU 筛选可索引、预处理，必要时 Worker。</li>\\n<li>使用 <code>useDeferredValue</code> 或 Transition 让输入优先，但它不减少总计算。</li>\\n<li>只有 Profiler 证明重复昂贵计算时才 <code>useMemo</code>。</li>\\n<li>稳定 key，缩小 Context/全局 store 的订阅范围。</li>\\n<li>同条件记录输入延迟、render/commit 时间和 memory。</li>\\n</ol>\\n"},{"id":"q106-section-1","title":"示例骨架","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function SearchableList({ items }) {\\n  const [query, setQuery] = useState('')\\n  const deferredQuery = useDeferredValue(query)\\n<p>const filtered = useMemo(\\r\\n() => filterItems(items, deferredQuery),\\r\\n[items, deferredQuery],\\r\\n)</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">return (\\r\\n&#x3C;>\\r\\n&#x3C;input value={query} onChange={e => setQuery(e.target.value)} />\\r\\n&#x3C;VirtualList items={filtered} />\\r\\n&#x3C;/>\\r\\n)\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<p>代码只是候选方案，是否使用每个优化必须由测量决定。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2539}},{"id":107,"slug":"question-107","title":"如何测试一个异步表单？","category":"react","type":"scenario","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","测试"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q107-section-0","title":"参考思路","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-tsx\\">test('submits and shows success state', async () => {\\n  const user = userEvent.setup()\\n  server.use(\\n    http.post('/api/projects', async ({ request }) => {\\n      const body = await request.json()\\n      return HttpResponse.json({ id: 'p1', ...body })\\n    }),\\n  )\\n<p>render(&#x3C;ProjectForm />)</p>\\n<p>await user.type(screen.getByRole('textbox', { name: /name/i }), 'Alpha')\\r\\nawait user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /create/i }))</p>\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-tsx\\">expect(await screen.findByText(/created/i)).toBeVisible()\\r\\n})\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n"},{"id":"q107-section-1","title":"评分点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>按角色/label 查询，不依赖 class 或内部 state。</li>\\n<li>使用用户级交互和等待式断言。</li>\\n<li>mock 自己的网络边界，而不是 mock React Hook 实现。</li>\\n<li>另测失败、重复提交和校验；测试之间数据隔离。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2581}},{"id":108,"slug":"question-108","title":"设计权限组件时怎样避免“前端鉴权”误区？","category":"react","type":"scenario","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React","权限"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"","answerSections":[{"id":"q108-section-0","title":"参考设计","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-tsx\\">function Can({ permission, children, fallback = null }) {\\n  const allowed = usePermission(permission)\\n  return allowed ? children : fallback\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这只是展示控制。真正 API 必须在服务端按用户、租户、资源和动作鉴权。前端权限模型应来自受信任 session/permission response，并处理权限动态变化和 403。测试至少覆盖角色 × 权限矩阵，而不是只测 admin。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2618}},{"id":109,"slug":"question-109","title":"React 代码审查题：找出问题","category":"react","type":"debugging","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function UserList({ users, query }) {\\r\\n  const [filtered, setFiltered] = useState([])\\r\\n\\r\\n  useEffect(() => {\\r\\n    users.sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name))\\r\\n    setFiltered(users.filter(user => user.name.includes(query)))\\r\\n  }, [users])\\r\\n\\r\\n  return filtered.map((user, index) => (\\r\\n    &#x3C;User key={index} user={user} />\\r\\n  ))\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>","answerSections":[{"id":"q109-section-0","title":"题解","html":"\\n<ol>\\n<li><code>sort</code> 修改 props。</li>\\n<li>filtered 可由 props/query 派生，不需 state + Effect。</li>\\n<li>dependency 漏了 query，产生旧结果。</li>\\n<li>Effect 使 UI 先 render 一次旧 filtered，再额外 render。</li>\\n<li>index key 在重排时破坏身份。</li>\\n<li>大数据量才考虑 memo，不能默认需要。</li>\\n</ol>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">function UserList({ users, query }) {\\n  const filtered = users\\n    .filter(user => user.name.includes(query))\\n    .toSorted((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name))\\n</code><p><code class=\\"language-jsx\\">return filtered.map(user => &#x3C;User key={user.id} user={user} />)\\r\\n}\\r\\n</code></p></pre><p></p>\\n<p>若环境不支持 <code>toSorted</code>，用 <code>[...array].sort(...)</code>。数据很大时再测量并决定 memo、索引、服务端处理或虚拟化。</p>\\n"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":2637}}]`);export{e as default};